"stats":[70,40,80,82,81,84],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1027305","horse":"WP29009"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10172","city":"CS1075","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,40,80,82,81,84],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1027305","horse":"WP29009"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"前赵开国皇帝刘渊的堂祖父，也是东汉末年南匈奴单于羌渠的儿子、於夫罗单于的弟弟。虽朴钝少言，但好学有修养。曾拜著名经学家孙炎为师，精通《毛诗》、《左传》等汉族典籍，被孙炎比作西汉名臣金日磾。西晋初年受晋武帝司马炎接见并获赞赏，被任命为右部都督。后为前赵建国的重要谋臣，官至丞相。","tc":"前趙開國皇帝劉淵的堂祖父，也是東漢末年南匈奴單于羌渠的兒子、於夫羅單于的弟弟。雖樸鈍少言，但好學有修養。曾拜著名經學家孫炎為師，精通《毛詩》、《左傳》等漢族典籍，被孫炎比作西漢名臣金日磾。西晉初年受晉武帝司馬炎接見并獲贊賞，被任命為右部都督。后為前趙建國的重要謀臣，官至丞相。","en":"The cousin-grandfather of Former Zhao's founding Emperor Liu Yuan, son of Southern Xiongnu Chanyu Qiangqu in the late Eastern Han dynasty, and younger brother of Chanyu Yufuluo. Although simple, blunt, and of few words, he was studious and refined. He studied under the famed classicist Sun Yan and mastered Han classics such as ‘Mao's Odes’ and the ‘Zuo Zhuan,’ earning comparison from Sun Yan to the famed Western Han minister Jin Midi. In the early Western Jin, he was granted an audience with Emperor Wu of Jin, Sima Yan, who praised him and appointed him Viceroy of the Right Division. Later, he became a key advisor in the founding of Former Zhao, eventually rising to Prime Minister.","jp":"前趙の開国皇帝・劉淵の従祖父であり、後漢末期の南匈奴単于・羌渠の子で、於夫羅単于の弟。実直かつ寡黙な性格であったが、学問を好み教養に富んでいた。高名な経学者である孫炎に師事し、『毛詩』や『左伝』などの漢籍に通暁していたため、孫炎から西漢の名臣・金日磾に喩えられた。西晋の初年に武帝・司馬炎の引見を受けて賞賛され、右部都督に任じられた。後に前趙建国の重要な謀臣となり、官位は丞相にまで至った。","kr":"전조(前趙)의 개국황제 유연(劉淵)의 당조부이자, 동한 말 남흉노 선우 강거(羌渠)의 아들이며 어부라(於夫羅) 선우의 아우입니다. 성품이 우직하고 과묵했으나 배움을 좋아하고 교양이 깊었습니다. 일찍이 저명한 경학자 손염(孫炎)을 스승으로 모셔 《모시(毛詩)》, 《좌전(左傳)》 등 한족의 전적에 정통하여 손염에게 서한의 명신 김일제(金日磾)에 비견되기도 했습니다. 서진 초년에 진 무제 사마염을 접견하고 찬사를 받아 우부도독에 임명되었습니다. 훗날 전조 건국의 주요 모신으로 활약하였으며, 관직은 승상에 이르렀습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1044515","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"宣","nameTc":"宣","nameEn":"Xuan","nameJp":"宣","nameKr":"선","nameOther":"","word":"士则","wordTc":"士則","wordEn":"Shize","wordJp":"士則","wordKr":"사칙","wordOther":"","icon":"刘宣","power":"WJ10172","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"200","city":"CS1075","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"40","wise":"80","politics":"82","charm":"81","will":"84","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"14","weaponMaster":"20/16/18/22/22/80/17/19","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5400","battleSoulPoint":"4200","debateSoulPoint":"500","strategy":"","strategy2":"1005001","professions":"2/0/1/3/0/0/2/3/2/3/3/2/0/3/0/0/2/3/0/3/0/3/2/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"4","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"2000","title":"1","rank":"1","birth":"187","show":"200","death":"308","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"4","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1027305","treasure":"","horse":"WP29009","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;3/1;14/1;25/1;9/2;28/1;13/0;45/1;30/0;8/0;21/1","father":"WJ1044415/0","mother":"","children":"","family":"WJ10340/100;WJ10172/100","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"前赵开国皇帝刘渊的堂祖父，也是东汉末年南匈奴单于羌渠的儿